5c:["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"大概率是邮箱后缀的问题。它的注册页不让你自由输入邮箱，@ 后面只能从 11 个白名单后缀里选：gmail.com、qq.com、163.com、yahoo.com、sina.com、126.com、outlook.com、yeah.net、foxmail.com、pronton.me、protonmail.com。"}],["$","$1","1",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"公司邮箱和自建域名邮箱一律注册不了。"}]}],["$","$1","2",{"children":" 特别注意 "}],["$","$1","3",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"pronton.me"}]}],["$","$1","4",{"children":" 这一项——它是 "}],["$","$1","5",{"children":["$","code",null,{"className":"border border-rule bg-card px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.85em] text-accent","children":"proton.me"}]}],["$","$1","6",{"children":" 打错的，本文查过 DNS，这个域名根本不存在，选它绝对收不到验证码；而真正用 @proton.me 地址的人在下拉里找不到自己的后缀。Proton 用户请改用自己账号下的 @protonmail.com 地址，或者换个 Gmail。"}]]}]
